        <summary>
          <para>Generate a randomized MAC from a secret seed and information from the Wi-Fi configuration (SSID or Passpoint profile) and reuse it for all connections to this network. The randomized MAC address for this network will stay the same for each subsequent association until the device undergoes factory reset.</para>
